# Cursor local best practices

Read and follow [`.agents/skills/cursor-local-best-practices/SKILL.md`](../../.agents/skills/cursor-local-best-practices/SKILL.md) only when:

- Starting or stopping a local server / preview / proxy / tunnel
- Hitting `EADDRINUSE` or another port-in-use error
- Ending a conversation that opened ports in this chat
- The user explicitly asks for local session or port hygiene

Do **not** apply for ordinary edits, Q&A, docs, or tests that do not bind a long-lived port. Parallel chats in this repo are allowed for that work.
